---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Save sandboxes as templates and manage them

Usage: sbt template [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  save  Save a snapshot of the sandbox as a template
  ls    List templates [alias: list]
  rm    Remove a template [aliases: remove, delete]
  load  Load a template from a file made by `template save --output`
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

  -h, --help
          Print help
